  "description": "<p>GH Issue was raised <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/pull/2184\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/pull/2184</a>  <br/>\nUser was experiencing different behaviour between file uploads to S3 backed Fedora. Peter Winkles identified the issue was a lack of path style support for the s3crtClient. I provided a PR <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/pull/2184\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/pull/2184</a>  to add this and the user confirmed that this resolved the issue for them. </p>\n",
